1 BIRT
2 DATE 30 DEC 1874
2 PLAC Krasniczyn, Chelm, Lublin, Poland
2 NOTE Birth act 5/1875, Wojslawice (sources/fond1787/birth-indexes/a5_75_top.jpg,
3 CONT a5_75_bot.jpg). Registered in the posad of Wojslawice on 6 January 1875 at ten in
3 CONT the morning. The child was born in the VILLAGE OF KRASNICZYN on 30 December 1874
3 CONT at eleven at night. Declarant: MOSZKO MOSKAL, SHOEMAKER, aged 33, an inhabitant of
3 CONT the posad of Wojslawice temporarily residing in the village of Krasniczyn.
3 CONT Mother: RUCHLA LAJA nee BIRMAN, aged 19. Witnesses: Eli Gochman, shoemaker, 63,
3 CONT and Kiwa Becher, worker, 35, both of Krasniczyn. Name given: BRANA GITLA.
1 NOTE ENTERED 22 Aug 2026. The act was located and read on 20 Aug 2026 (finding 114) but
2 CONT was never entered into the tree - a documented person missing from the file. Found
2 CONT by checking the nine children Geni ascribes to Abram-Moszko against the GEDCOM.
2 CONT IDENTIFICATION: the act names the father only as "Moszko Moskal, shoemaker, of
2 CONT Krasniczyn". What fixes him as ABRAM-Moszko @I1062@ and not his brother
2 CONT ARON-Moszko @I1074@ is the MOTHER: Ruchla-Laja nee Birman is Abram-Moszko's wife
2 CONT @I1066@, whereas Aron-Moszko's wife is Cywia Rajner. Same couple as Ita's act
2 CONT 22/1882 and Henia's act 37/1881.
2 CONT >>> OPEN: the father's stated age drifts - 33 in Jan 1875 (b. ~1841) against 35 in
2 CONT Nov 1881 (b. ~1846) and 36 in Dec 1882 (b. ~1846). The 1875 figure is the outlier.
1 NOTE GENI (c) 22 Aug 2026 - UNVERIFIED, NOT USED as evidence, recorded only so the next
2 CONT researcher can test it: the Geni World Family Tree profile managed by Pazit Nudel,
2 CONT and two MyHeritage trees (Kagan; Wertzberger), give a Brana Gitla Moskal who
2 CONT married BEINISCH BENJAMIN HELFMAN, had four children (Moshe, Natan Neta, Yitko,
2 CONT Bracha) and died in 1943 at Oswiecim. Those trees state her birth as 1897 at
2 CONT "Kraszniecin" - TWENTY-TWO YEARS after this act. Either two different women or an
2 CONT error in the trees. NOT RESOLVED. Do not merge without a document.
1 SOUR @S1001@
1 FAMC @F1030@
