1 TITL The Jews of Opatow - list of murdered Jews from the memorial volume
1 AUTH Former residents of Opatow
1 PUBL Tel Aviv, 1988
1 TEXT Carries three of this family: Tomasz Rywenbajrich b.1888; Bajla Szajndla Rywenbajrych
2 CONT b.1891; Fajga Rachla Rywenbajrych b.1920 - all of Opatow, all entered as murdered at
2 CONT Treblinka on 23 October 1942.
1 NOTE INDEPENDENT of this family. Compiled by the survivors of the town itself, with no
2 CONT connection to our Pages of Testimony. It is what turns the family's account of
2 CONT Chana's parents from second-hand memory into a corroborated fact.
2 CONT NOT the same book as the 1966 "Apt" volume whose necrology I read at pp. 407-441 -
2 CONT confusing the two is what produced my earlier false claim that no Rywenbajrych appears
2 CONT in the Opatow yizkor literature.
1 NOTE Indexed by Yad Vashem, items 5074389, 5074390, 5074391.

