1 TITL Yad Vashem submitter index
1 TEXT Searchable by the name of the person who FILED a Page, not only the person
2 CONT commemorated: fields submitter_ln_search_en and submitter_fn_search_en.
2 CONT Alter Veisblum returns exactly two records in every spelling of the surname -
2 CONT the 1966 necrology entries for his parents - and no Pages of Testimony.
1 NOTE Reached from the terminal with albert/sources/tools/yv.py, which also carries the
2 CONT field names and known-positive controls. An unknown field name returns zero
2 CONT SILENTLY, so every negative here was validated against a control first. This index
2 CONT is what turned up Moshe's two unknown sheets and the whole of @F61@. findings/057.

