1 TITL CRARG transcriptions - Radoszyce Jewish registers (BMD 1826-1884) and Kielce-area collections
1 TEXT Full-row transcriptions with parents' names, ages, villages and occupations. Among
2 CONT them: marriage act 20/1849 (Kiwa Cukier x Rywa Winogron - both sets of parents named),
2 CONT birth act 40/1851 (Ester Gitla, Zagdansk village), marriage act 13/1857 (Laja Cukier,
2 CONT "living with her brother Kiwa Cukier, Zagdansk"), and the Kielce BMD/burial rows of
2 CONT the family's later decades.
1 NOTE Seven surname reports sent by Daniel Kazez (CRARG) on 14 Aug 2026; held at
2 CONT albert/sources/crarg/ with parsed TSVs and analysis notes (notes-first-sweep,
2 CONT notes-agent-full-sweep). Transcriptions, not the acts; the register images are on
2 CONT GenBaza (metryki). CRARG data is members-only, one-family use. Radoszyce BMD coverage
2 CONT 1826-1884, missing 1860-1865 (alegata partially fill it), 1874 and 1877. See
2 CONT findings/082-083.

