2 CONT created from an Ancestry tree, added 20 Oct 2023) and 270785911 (Helen); indexed
2 CONT on Ancestry as Canada, Find a Grave Index 60527/231768559 and 60527/241540127,
2 CONT and in JOWBR 1411/792231 (burial 29 Apr 1998, plot 49-A-43). Read 15 Aug 2026 -
2 CONT findagrave.com is behind a Cloudflare check, which Amotz cleared by hand.
2 CONT A stone is a strong primary source, but a Hebrew patronymic is a religious name
2 CONT and need not be the name in the civil act. See findings/088.

