2 CONT each contributing money to buy its first books; the books were kept at first in Sheva
2 CONT Klang's flat. Named again among "the girls who came to the library and devoured the books".
2 CONT The library was named for Ber Borochov - it was the Poalei Zion library.
2 CONT NOTE THE SYMMETRY: Lea Moskal founded the library; Dvora Schafir ran Poalei Zion's evening
2 CONT courses. The two families' daughters were in the same small Labour-Zionist circle - very
2 CONT likely how David Moskal and Malka Schafir came to know one another.
