1 TITL Yad Vashem, Central Database of Shoah Victims' Names - the Wojslawice corpus
1 TEXT Pages of Testimony for the Szafir sons: 1125024 "Yosef Shafir, age 60, b. Wojslawice,
2 CONT father Shmuel, mother Pesia, spouse Yokheved, tiler, murdered Wojslawice" (submitted by
2 CONT TZIPORA EINES LIS as "Granddaughter"); 483774 "Yosef Szafir, b. 1890 Wojslawice, father
2 CONT Shmuel, mother Peshe, roofer" (YEHOSHUA LAM, "Relative"); 1664477 "Yisrael Szafir,
2 CONT b. 1890 Wojslawice, father Shmuel, mother Peshe, merchant, d. Chelm" (YEHOSHUA LEV,
2 CONT "Relative"). And for the generation above: 1269979 "Paja / Paia Alspektor, age 70
2 CONT (b. 1872), BORN WOJSLAWICE, spouse Hersh, murdered Wlodawa ghetto 1942" (MALKA MUSKAL,
2 CONT "Granddaughter") - Dwora Moskal's mother, with her own record at last.
1 NOTE Retrieved 14 Aug 2026 by pulling Yad Vashem's entire Wojslawice corpus - 1,302 victim
2 CONT records, place-synonym search across birth, pre-war, wartime and death place - and
2 CONT matching it against the 1940 German confiscation list of 139 Wojslawice property owners.
2 CONT Raw rows: wojslawice/sources/notes-confiscation-list-vs-yadvashem.md. Analysis:
2 CONT findings/yadvashem-wojslawice-corpus-szafir-brothers-and-paja.md.
2 CONT ⚠ A Page of Testimony is a form filled in decades after the events by a relative, not a
2 CONT contemporaneous record. Ages on these forms are demonstrably unreliable - Dwora Moskal
2 CONT has two Pages giving 59 and 65, and Paja's 70 would make her only five years older than
2 CONT her own daughter. Names and relationships carry the weight here; years do not.
2 CONT ⚠ ALSO: three living threads surfaced - TZIPORA EINES LIS (granddaughter of Yosef, i.e.
2 CONT descendants of Mendel's brother), YEHOSHUA LAM / LEV, and KHAIA BERGERSON (Blander).

