3 CONT Imie SAMUL." Signed: Srul Glezer, Jankiel Szautor.
2 CONT AGES CROSS-CHECK EXACTLY: Srul 38 in 1856 => b. ~1818, against 27 in 1847 => ~1820.
2 CONT Chana 35 in 1856 => b. ~1821, against 25 in 1847 => ~1822. Both within ordinary drift.
2 CONT The witness LEJBA NUDEL, flour merchant, 40 - Chaja-Ruchla nee Glezer's husband, i.e.
2 CONT Srul's brother-in-law - is the same man who witnessed act 26/1847 for the elder son.
