2 NOTE ** DEATH ACT 16/1823 OF THE STRAWCZYN REGISTER (@S1051@), read from the certified
3 CONT extract 28 Aug 2026. ** She died on 20 September 1823 at two in the afternoon, in
3 CONT house no. 60, aged twenty-eight, "Zona pozostalego AARONA CUKROWICZA w Rudzie
3 CONT zamieszkalego Potasznika". Declared two days later.
