2 NOTE Act 23 of the Checiny civil register for 1823, karta 211, at ten in the morning before
3 CONT Rev. Antoni Jedryszko. BOTH parties proved their age by an AKT ZNANIA drawn in the
3 CONT Sad Pokoju of Kielce powiat - not by a kahal certificate, which is how Aron and Tauba
3 CONT proved theirs six months later at Strawczyn. Four Jewish witnesses of Checiny.
3 CONT >>> THREE MONTHS AND TEN DAYS LATER the groom's father was dead, and it was this same
3 CONT Joachym who declared the death (act 220/1823, @S1054@).
